The remaining weight to remove is:

$$
15 - 7.5 = 7.5 \text{ pounds}
$$

Each toy weighs $\frac{1}{2}$ pound. The number of toys required to remove 7.5 pounds is:

$$
7.5 \div \frac{1}{2} = 7.5 \times 2 = 15
$$

